===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:amounten|tree=1}}
{{root|en|ine-pro|*men-|id=stand out}}
From {{inh|en|enm|amounten||to mount up to, come up to, signify}}, from {{der|en|fro|amonter||to amount to}}, from {{m|fro|amont}}, {{m|fro|amunt||uphill, upward}}, from the [[prepositional phrase]] {{m|fro|a mont||toward or to a mountain or heap}}, from {{der|en|la|ad montem}}, from {{m|la|ad||to}} + {{m|la|montem}}, accusative of {{m|la|mons||mountain}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/əˈmaʊnt/}}, {{enPR|ə.mount'}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-amount.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|aʊnt|s=2}}
<!-- 2 syllable words !-->

